<section class="page-hero" style="--hero-img: url('/assets/images/experience/cae/b737_hero.JPG');">
    <div class="page-hero__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
        <p class="page-hero__kicker">Operator / Technician</p>
        <h1 class="page-hero__title">CAE Amsterdam B.V.</h1>
        <p class="page-hero__sub">Engineering Department • 2022 - 2026 • Amsterdam, NL</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
    <div class="container story__grid">
        <figure class="media media--4x3">
            {% img "assets/images/experience/cae/seat.jpeg", "CAE instructor seat" %}
        </figure>

        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">Reality or Simulation</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                CAE is a global leader in training for the civil aviation industry, providing comprehensive solutions
                that encompass flight simulators, training services, and advanced technologies. and simulation.</p>
                <p class="story__text">With <strong>18 Level D full-flight simulators</strong> of various aircraft types, CAE AMSTERDAM B.V. center 
                is one of the key facilities within CAE's global network, providing a state-of-the-art training environment for 
                pilots and aviation personnel.
                </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="story story--reverse">
    <div class="container story__grid">

        <figure class="media media--4x3">
            {% img "assets/images/experience/cae/apt_night.jpeg", "A320 APT panel night" %}
        </figure>


        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">Everyday Work</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                After my internship work at CAE Amsterdam, I have continued in a part-time position as a simulator technician
                in engineering department. My role involves maintaining and operating flight simulators, ensuring their optimal performance for pilot training.
                This position allows me to gain hands-on experience with cutting-edge simulation technology and certification processes.
            </p>
            <p class="story__text">Want to see more about my internship work at CAE?</p>
            <a href="/sound/" class="story__link">Sound analysis</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
    <div class="container story__grid">
        <figure class="media media--4x3">
            {% img "assets/images/experience/cae/simhall.jpeg", "CAE simulator hall" %}
        </figure>

        <div class="story__content">
            <h2 class="story__title">Sometimes dirty...</h2>
            <p class="story__text">
                Work at CAE is not only about working with high-tech simulators,
                but also about maintaining the facilities and ensuring that everything runs smoothly.
                From software, hardware visual and audio systems to hydraulic motion systems, there is always something to do.
                Hands-on work is a big part of my job, and I enjoy the variety of tasks that come with it.
            </div>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>


<section class="related">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="related__head">
            <h1 class="related__title">Related projects</h1>
            <p class="logo-band__label">More work in testing, data processing, coding…</p>
        </div>
         <div class="projects__carousel" aria-label="Projects carousel">
      <div class="projects__grid" id="projectsGrid">
        {% for id in featuredProjects %}
          {% set p = projects[id] %}
          {% if p %}
            {% include "components/project-card.njk" %}
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      <div class="projects__dots" aria-label="Project navigation"></div>
    </div>
</section>
